Run from RL/work/LT:  PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 /tmp/oph-completion-venv/bin/python -B lt_statements.py
Reads the public checkout (read only). Each entry is (file, phrase, status); the phrase must occur on one line of the
current tree. Writes statements_check.json and STATEMENTS.md in this directory.
"""
